{"title": "Nimblefinger", "pageid": 28624, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Nimblefinger", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Nimblefinger</b> is a passive feature that grants bonuses to small size races.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnomes</a> are granted +2 to <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> gain +1 Dexterity. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nimblefinger_Gloves\" title=\"Nimblefinger Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Gloves_Leather_G_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Nimblefinger_Gloves\" title=\"Nimblefinger Gloves\">Nimblefinger Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Being <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">disguised</a> as a Dwarf, Gnome, or Halfling when equipping the item also activates the effect. This effect persists even if dispelled, but doing so does not survive a reload.</li>\n<li>The Dexterity bonus is uncapped, and can therefore increase <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> to 24 in combination with the <a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_of_Loss\" title=\"Mirror of Loss\">Mirror of Loss</a>.\n<ul><li>However, the gloves <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Priority\" title=\"Abilities\">do not stack</a> with other capped Dexterity bonuses when Dexterity is above any of those caps. Therefore, this does not work if combined with a feat like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resilient:_Dexterity\" title=\"Resilient: Dexterity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Resilient_Icon.webp/20px-Resilient_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Resilient_Icon.webp/30px-Resilient_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Resilient_Icon.webp/40px-Resilient_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resilient: Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Resilient_Icon.webp/20px-Resilient_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Resilient_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resilient:_Dexterity\" title=\"Resilient: Dexterity\">Resilient: Dexterity</a>, which caps at 20.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043